Subject: is it possible to include radial distances in distance sampling with line transects
Message-ID: <sljRfTUPBzE.UEoQJS0gAwAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/distance-sampling/c/sljRfTUPBzE/m/UEoQJS0gAwAJ>
